This is a MODIFIED redistribution: the upstream Python definitions were reformatted to JSON and
reduced to the `fides_key`, `name` and `description` fields. No other change was made to the
meaning of any entry.

The taxonomy is used as the bundled data-category vocabulary for the `ai-inventory` validator, so
that an AI inventory and a Fides privacy data map describe data in the same language.

Snapshot provenance, and how to refresh it, are documented in
plugins/ai-inventory/references/taxonomy/SOURCE.md.

